Z||000000||rc5star||08-10-2001||07:04 AM||||Im in the process of putting my engine back together (first time ever  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> and im having trouble with the harness that plugs into the back of the 6 fuel injectors. Which goes where? I put numbers on the harness but forgot where I said "this is number one". I have a factory manual, the Chilton and the Haynes so if there is a picture or chart in any of these please let me know. I have looked but have had no luck. <P>Thanks for the help!||||reg||8
Z||000001||Carrolles||08-10-2001||08:09 AM||||If I recall correctly the harness approaches the injectors from the water pump side of the engine and the sockets should line up with the injectors.||||reg||1
