Z||000003||Carrolles||08-10-2001||04:04 PM||||Take a look at this schematic.<BR> <A HREF="http://home.t-online.de/home/u.moeller-objects/schalt9.GIF" TARGET=_blank>http://home.t-online.de/home/u.moeller-objects/schalt9.GIF</A> <P>The injectors are wired up in two banks.  In a particular bank I don't think it matters which connector goes to which injector.  I'm really not sure that it matters which bank of injectors gets which color wires either since thay fire in batches.<P>On the Fiero V-6 the injectors don't fire individually for each cylinder.<P>Theogre may have some insight here.||||reg||1
